abstract: >-
  Thematic micro-paper suite (Papers 0 and A through L, 14 Zenodo Hubs) and 64 self-contained,
  linter-verified modular Lean 4 formalization units (Series 1-8, updated from 57, 58, 59, 60, 61, 62, and 63) verified in
  Lean 4.35.0 with zero custom axioms and zero sorry. Conditional equivalences parameterize their analytic hypotheses explicitly (MSC 2020 11M26, 46E20, 68V20).
